        "data source date": "2025-02-07 00:00:00",
        "notes": "Figure 1.1 on page 6 of the MNES Annual Report Olive Downs Coking Coal Project, published Feb 7 2025, https://web.archive.org/web/2/https://www.pembrokeresources.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/E230778-MNES-Annual-Report.pdf, shows the mine site boundary. Based on information from the Queensland Mining Leases dataset https://web.archive.org/web/2/https://www.data.qld.gov.au/dataset/queensland-mining-and-exploration-tenure-series/resource/f87794b8-7b9a-4732-89bb-56ccb2228d27, the boundary includes mining leases ML 700032 through 700036. The area of the boundary is 249 sq km. Note that the ML 70354 'Olive Downs A' lease to the north is a part of the Moorvale South mine, not the Olive Downs mine.\n\nMining lease geometries were extracted from the Queensland Mining Leases dataset (https://web.archive.org/web/2/https://www.data.qld.gov.au/dataset/queensland-mining-and-exploration-tenure-series/resource/f87794b8-7b9a-4732-89bb-56ccb2228d27).",
